#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:1
msgid "big.js"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:3
msgid ""
"**A small, fast JavaScript library for arbitrary-precision decimal "
"arithmetic.**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:5
msgid ""
"The little sister to "
"[bignumber.js](https://github.com/MikeMcl/bignumber.js/) and "
"[decimal.js](https://github.com/MikeMcl/decimal.js/). See "
"[here](https://github.com/MikeMcl/big.js/wiki) for some notes on the "
"difference between them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:7
msgid "Features"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:9
msgid ""
"Faster, smaller and easier-to-use than JavaScript versions of Java's "
"BigDecimal"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:10
msgid "Only 5.9 KB minified and 2.7 KB gzipped"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:11
msgid "Simple API"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:12
msgid ""
"Replicates the `toExponential`, `toFixed` and `toPrecision` methods of "
"JavaScript's Number type"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:13
msgid "Includes a `sqrt` method"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:14
msgid "Stores values in an accessible decimal floating point format"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:15
msgid "No dependencies"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:16
msgid ""
"Comprehensive [documentation](http://mikemcl.github.io/big.js/) and test "
"set"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:18
msgid "Set up"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:20
msgid ""
"The library is the single JavaScript file *big.js* (or *big.min.js*, "
"which is *big.js* minified)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:22
msgid "Browser:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:28
msgid "[Node.js](http://nodejs.org):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:38
msgid "ES6 module:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:43
msgid "Use"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:45
msgid ""
"*In all examples below, `var`, semicolons and `toString` calls are not "
"shown. If a commented-out value is in quotes it means `toString` has been"
" called on the preceding expression.*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:47
msgid ""
"The library exports a single function, `Big`, the constructor of Big "
"number instances. It accepts a value of type number, string or Big number"
" object."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:55
msgid ""
"A Big number is immutable in the sense that it is not changed by its "
"methods."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:62
msgid "The methods that return a Big number can be chained."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:67
msgid ""
"Like JavaScript's Number type, there are `toExponential`, `toFixed` and "
"`toPrecision` methods."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:74
msgid ""
"The arithmetic methods always return the exact result except `div`, "
"`sqrt` and `pow` (with negative exponent), as these methods involve "
"division."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:77
msgid ""
"The maximum number of decimal places and the rounding mode used to round "
"the results of these methods is determined by the value of the `DP` and "
"`RM` properties of the `Big` number constructor."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:90
msgid ""
"Multiple Big number constructors can be created, each with an independent"
" configuration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:92
msgid ""
"The value of a Big number is stored in a decimal floating point format in"
" terms of a coefficient, exponent and sign."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:99
msgid ""
"For further information see the [API](http://mikemcl.github.io/big.js/) "
"reference from the *doc* folder."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:101
msgid "Test"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:103
msgid "The *test* directory contains the test scripts for each Big number method."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:105
msgid "The tests can be run with Node.js or a browser."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:107
msgid "To run all the tests"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:111
msgid "To test a single method"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:115
msgid ""
"For the browser, see *single-test.html* and *every-test.html* in the "
"*test/browser* directory."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:117
msgid ""
"*big-vs-number.html* is a simple application that enables some of the "
"methods of big.js to be compared with those of JavaScript's Number type."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:119
msgid "Performance"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:121
msgid ""
"The *perf* directory contains two legacy applications and a *lib* "
"directory containing the BigDecimal libraries used by both."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:123
msgid ""
"*big-vs-bigdecimal.html* tests the performance of big.js against the "
"JavaScript translations of two versions of BigDecimal, its use should be "
"more or less self-explanatory."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:125
