msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:128
msgid ""
"The BigDecimal in the npm registry is the GWT version. It has some bugs, "
"see the Node.js script *perf/lib/bigdecimal_GWT/bugs.js* for examples of "
"flaws in its *remainder*, *divide* and *compareTo* methods."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:130
msgid ""
"*bigtime.js* is a Node.js command-line application which tests the "
"performance of big.js against the GWT version of BigDecimal from the npm "
"registry."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:133
msgid ""
"For example, to compare the time taken by the big.js `plus` method and "
"the BigDecimal `add` method"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big.js_README.md:137
msgid ""
"This will time 10000 calls to each, using operands of up to 40 random "
"digits and will check that the results match."
msgstr ""

